<http://data.silknow.org/object/23db1b0f-00ab-3cd6-b51f-49a6a26f06bc/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Sample of figured silk dress fabric. The pattern shows broad, bright blue satin stripes bordered with cream, alternating  with areas of black satin ground woven with a Japanese design. The design is Jacquard woven in red, blue and white on a black satin ground and shows large fan shapes filled with stylised flowers superimposed on a delicate floral trail. There is a selvedge at one side."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/23db1b0f-00ab-3cd6-b51f-49a6a26f06bc> .

